### CG-R1-MAJ-001: DISPATCH-NOTE bootstrap-fix closure note says 'paths-ignore' but workflow uses 'paths' whitelist

**Bug:** docs/reviews/WP-SCP-024/024B-extras/DISPATCH-NOTE.md §Carry-forward known findings R8-Bootstrap closure note reads 'CLOSED in 024B-extras via paths-ignore 024[AB]*/**'. The actual `.github/workflows/check-invocation-log-entry.yml` uses a `paths:` whitelist (`docs/reviews/WP-SCP-024/024[C-Z]*/**`) — these are different mechanisms. Documentation-mechanism mismatch. Audit-trail drift.

